            "review_text": "Sơn Nguyen\nHanoi, Vietnam7 contributions\n0\nVery bad -tasteless-dont come here\nJan 2020 • Couples\nDont come here\n26/01/2020-Dinner time.\nAs a vietnamese from Hanoi-im not gonna call this is Banh Mi.Shame for Vietnamese Banh Mi.the owner should be close this store. In fairness the difference in many other one.\n Only two paper of pork inside big as my finger and close to no flavour. Had no punch, nothing to send your tastebuds into wanting more. Hugely disappointing. Maybe a banh mi shop for tourists. Nothing like real and genuine Vietnamese banh mi. Avoid and enjoy the difference and pocket the change. Staff not friendly at all. I understand surcharge for new year is normal I'm happy with that.\n But that price over charge with tasteless Bread is unacceptable. Never never come back again.I havent eat any Banh My small size for 95k.That price for Michellin restaurants .\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 26, 2020",
