            "review_text": "Hazelnut778\n1 contribution\n0\nNot the best ones yet!\nMar 2019 • Friends\nSadly the employees weren’t very enthusiastic and i couldn’t order a small sized Banh Mi besides the option to order a small being written down on the menu. So i went with a large one, because i was in a hurry and hadn’t had time to find a different stall. I really don’t like to be tucked up in this way and somehow you could read in the face of the employee that he didn’t tell the truth. Aside of beeing tricked on, the Banh Mi hadn’t had a special taste. It was eatable. So i can’t really recommend the Paperman Banh Mi. Better look for a different one.\nRead more\nWritten March 28, 2019",
